<title>DENMARK: Nordic Investment Bank issue 500 mln Dkk 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Nordic Investment Bank issue 500 mln Dkk 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Unidanmark on Friday.</p>
<p>BORROWER - Nordic Investment Bank. LEAD MGR - Unidanmark. AMOUNT</p>
<p>- 500 MLN DKK. MATURITY - 2003.  COUPON - 4 pct.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
